-- schema: project v1 v2
-- A data directory OpenCode used through all three generations: the
-- storage files 1.2 imported, the V1 tables, and the V2 tables 2.0
-- migrated them into. ses_up is in all three, its storage copy holding
-- a message the database lacks, and OpenCode 2 carried it on after the
-- migration; ses_done was migrated and not carried on; ses_new is
-- OpenCode 2's alone; ses_files is in the storage files alone. Written
-- by hand; no row of a real database.
